# makeit-artwork-verifier — transfer boundary exclusions (WP2)
#
# This repository is a private, toolkit-only snapshot. Anything that carries
# historical evidence, source provenance, machine-local state, credentials, or
# generated output must never enter Git. Patterns are anchored to the repository
# root unless a `**/` prefix is used so that a product-owned directory such as
# `src/coverage/` or `src/evidence/` is never accidentally excluded.

# --- WP1 planning / provenance inventory (never committed) ---
/.planning/

# --- Verification evidence (historical and generated; never committed) ---
# Historical run/suite records are revision-bound, contain maintainer-local
# absolute paths, and stay outside the transfer boundary. New runs are written
# here at runtime and are reproduced locally, not transferred.
/evidence/
/.pi/skills/verify-artwork-editor/evidence/

# --- Dependencies ---
node_modules/
.pnpm-store/

# --- Environment and credentials ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.keystore
/credentials/
/credentials.json
/secrets.json

# --- Build output, caches and generated local test artifacts ---
/.next/
/dist/
/build/
/out/
/coverage/
/tmp/
/.turbo/
/.cache/
/.vitest/
/vitest.cache/
*.tsbuildinfo
playwright-report/
/test-results/
/playwright/.cache/

# --- OS / editor noise ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.log

# --- Packaging scratch ---
*.tgz
